#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: kanasta.php
msgid "Kanasta – Chat Orders for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Kanasta – Chat Orders for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: kanasta.php
msgid "https://wordpress.org/plugins/kanasta/"
msgstr "https://es.wordpress.org/plugins/kanasta/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: kanasta.php
msgid ""
"Let customers place real WooCommerce orders and send them to you on "
"WhatsApp. Adds an \"Order via WhatsApp\" checkout method plus WhatsApp "
"buttons on product and cart pages."
msgstr ""
"Tus clientes hacen pedidos reales en WooCommerce y te los envían por "
"WhatsApp. Agrega el método \"Pedido por WhatsApp\" al checkout y botones de "
"WhatsApp en las páginas de producto y carrito."

#. Author of the plugin
#: kanasta.php
msgid "Marcos Arellano"
msgstr "Marcos Arellano"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: kanasta.php
msgid "https://marcos-arellano.vercel.app"
msgstr "https://marcos-arellano.vercel.app"

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:31
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:45
msgid ""
"Kanasta is almost ready: add your store WhatsApp number to start receiving "
"orders."
msgstr ""
"Kanasta está casi listo: agrega el número de WhatsApp de tu tienda para "
"empezar a recibir pedidos."

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:47
msgid "Add number"
msgstr "Agregar número"

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:60
msgid "Several WhatsApp numbers (sales team) with automatic rotation"
msgstr "Varios números de WhatsApp (equipo de ventas) con rotación automática"

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:61
msgid "Business hours: hide the buttons or show a notice when you are closed"
msgstr ""
"Horario de atención: oculta los botones o muestra un aviso cuando estás "
"cerrado"

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:62
msgid ""
"One-click WhatsApp messages to the customer from the order screen (order "
"confirmed, shipped, ready for pickup, payment reminder)"
msgstr ""
"Mensajes de WhatsApp al cliente con un clic desde el pedido (pedido "
"confirmado, en camino, listo para retirar, recordatorio de pago)"

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:66
msgid "Kanasta Pro"
msgstr "Kanasta Pro"

#: includes/class-kanasta-admin.php:73
msgid "Upgrade to Pro"
msgstr "Pasar a Pro"

#: includes/class-kanasta-buttons.php:40
msgid "Please choose the product options first."
msgstr "Primero elige las opciones del producto."

#: includes/class-kanasta-float.php:89
msgid "Chat on WhatsApp"
msgstr "Chatear por WhatsApp"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:28
msgid "Order via WhatsApp (Kanasta)"
msgstr "Pedido por WhatsApp (Kanasta)"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:29
msgid ""
"The order is created in WooCommerce and the customer is sent to WhatsApp "
"with all the order details, so you can agree on payment and delivery in the "
"chat."
msgstr ""
"El pedido se crea en WooCommerce y el cliente pasa a WhatsApp con todos los "
"datos del pedido, para que acuerden el pago y la entrega en el chat."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:50
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Activar/Desactivar"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:52
msgid "Enable \"Order via WhatsApp\" at checkout"
msgstr "Activar \"Pedido por WhatsApp\" en el checkout"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:56
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Título"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:58
msgid "Name of the option customers see at checkout."
msgstr "Nombre de la opción que ven los clientes en el checkout."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:59
#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:112
msgid "Order via WhatsApp"
msgstr "Pedir por WhatsApp"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:63
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:65
msgid "Shown below the option at checkout."
msgstr "Se muestra debajo de la opción en el checkout."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:66
msgid ""
"Place your order and we will open WhatsApp so you can send it to us. We "
"agree on payment and delivery in the chat."
msgstr ""
"Confirma tu pedido y abriremos WhatsApp para que nos lo envíes. Acordamos el"
" pago y la entrega por el chat."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:70
msgid "Order received text"
msgstr "Texto de pedido recibido"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:72
msgid ""
"Shown on the order received page and in the order email, above the WhatsApp "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra en la página de pedido recibido y en el correo del pedido, encima"
" del botón de WhatsApp."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:73
msgid ""
"Your order is reserved. Send it to us on WhatsApp to confirm payment and "
"delivery."
msgstr ""
"Tu pedido está reservado. Envíanoslo por WhatsApp para confirmar el pago y "
"la entrega."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:77
msgid "Order status"
msgstr "Estado del pedido"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:79
msgid ""
"\"On hold\" reserves stock and waits for you to confirm payment. \"Pending "
"payment\" does not reduce stock."
msgstr ""
"\"En espera\" reserva el stock y espera a que confirmes el pago. \"Pendiente"
" de pago\" no descuenta stock."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:82
msgctxt "Order status"
msgid "On hold"
msgstr "En espera"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:83
msgctxt "Order status"
msgid "Pending payment"
msgstr "Pendiente de pago"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:84
msgctxt "Order status"
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "Procesando"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:89
msgid "Open WhatsApp automatically"
msgstr "Abrir WhatsApp automáticamente"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:91
msgid ""
"Open WhatsApp automatically on the order received page (a button is always "
"shown too)"
msgstr ""
"Abrir WhatsApp automáticamente en la página de pedido recibido (siempre se "
"muestra también un botón)"

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:117
#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:120
msgid ""
"Order placed via WhatsApp. Waiting for the customer to confirm in the chat."
msgstr ""
"Pedido hecho por WhatsApp. Esperando que el cliente confirme en el chat."

#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:168
#: includes/class-kanasta-gateway.php:199
msgid "Send my order via WhatsApp"
msgstr "Enviar mi pedido por WhatsApp"

#: includes/class-kanasta-plugin.php:169
msgid "Kanasta needs WooCommerce to be installed and active."
msgstr "Kanasta necesita que WooCommerce esté instalado y activo."

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:44
msgid "WhatsApp number"
msgstr "Número de WhatsApp"

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:47
msgid "Checkout: \"Order via WhatsApp\""
msgstr "Checkout: \"Pedido por WhatsApp\""

#. translators: %s: link to the WooCommerce payments settings.
#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:50
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers choose \"Order via WhatsApp\" at checkout: the order is created in"
" WooCommerce and they are sent to WhatsApp with this message. Enable it and "
"change its title in %s."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes eligen \"Pedido por WhatsApp\" en el checkout: el pedido se "
"crea en WooCommerce y pasan a WhatsApp con este mensaje. Actívalo y cambia "
"su título en %s."

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:51
msgid "WooCommerce → Settings → Payments"
msgstr "WooCommerce → Ajustes → Pagos"

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:55
msgid "Product page button"
msgstr "Botón en la página de producto"

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:58
msgid "Cart page button"
msgstr "Botón en el carrito"

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:61
msgid "Floating chat button"
msgstr "Botón flotante de chat"

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:62
msgid ""
"A round WhatsApp button fixed in a corner of every page, so visitors can ask"
" you anything."
msgstr ""
"Un botón redondo de WhatsApp fijo en una esquina de todas las páginas, para "
"que los visitantes te consulten lo que quieran."

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:89
msgid "Store WhatsApp number"
msgstr "Número de WhatsApp de la tienda"

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:90
msgid ""
"Full international number with country code, e.g. 595981123456. Spaces, "
"\"+\" and dashes are removed automatically."
msgstr ""
"Número internacional completo con código de país, por ejemplo 595981123456. "
"Los espacios, el \"+\" y los guiones se quitan solos."

#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:97
msgid "Order message"
msgstr "Mensaje del pedido"

#. translators: %s: list of placeholders.
#: includes/class-kanasta-settings.php:99
#, php-format
